\">\n    <div class=\"tgme_widget_message_photo grouped_media\" style=\"top:0;bottom:0;left:-1px;right:0px;\"><\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/a>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div><div class=\"tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text\" dir=\"auto\"><i class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url('\/\/telegram.org\/img\/emoji\/40\/F09F87B0F09F87AC.png')\"><b>🇰🇬<\/b><\/i> I loved the people and nature of Kyrgyzstan — a real hidden gem of Central Asia. The weather was great, and there were no mosquitoes, so we hiked and rode horses a lot in the mountains and around the Issyk-Kul lake. I noticed that Kyrgyzstan is developing very fast, adding valuable infrastructure across the country <i class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url('\/\/telegram.org\/img\/emoji\/40\/F09F9A80.png')\"><b>🚀<\/b><\/i> <br\/><br\/><i class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url('\/\/telegram.org\/img\/emoji\/40\/E29C8AF09F8FBD.png')\"><b>✊🏽<\/b><\/i> More than half of the country’s population uses Telegram monthly, and in the last four months alone, Telegram&#39;s popularity grew by 30%. While there, we met with local telecom leaders and discussed ways to improve the experience of Kyrgyz Telegram users.<br\/><br\/>Thank you, Kyrgyzstan — we will be back soon. Your hospitality inspires me for my future trips around beautiful Central Asia <i class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url('\/\/telegram.org\/img\/emoji\/40\/E29DA4.png')\"><b>❤️<\/b><\/i><i class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url('\/\/telegram.org\/img\/emoji\/40\/F09F929B.png')\"><b>💛<\/b><\/i><\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"tgme_widget_message_reactions js-message_reactions\"><span class=\"tgme_reaction tgme_reaction_paid\"><i class=\"icon icon-telegram-stars\"><\/i>410<\/span><span class=\"tgme_reaction\"><i class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url('\/\/telegram.org\/img\/emoji\/40\/E29DA4E2808DF09F94A5.png')\"><b>❤‍🔥<\/b><\/i>55K<\/span><span class=\"tgme_reaction\"