ng')\"><b>✨<\/b><\/i><\/tg-emoji>During my trip to Uzbekistan I was amazed by the modern infrastructure of quickly developing Tashkent, the mountainous landscapes of Eastern Uzbekistan, and the rich history of Buhara and Samarkand <tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5470080737711502911\"><i class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url('\/\/telegram.org\/img\/emoji\/40\/F09F9296.png')\"><b>💖<\/b><\/i><\/tg-emoji><br\/><br\/><tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5425141507050973573\"><i class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url('\/\/telegram.org\/img\/emoji\/40\/F09F8F84E2808DE29982.png')\"><b>🏄‍♂️<\/b><\/i><\/tg-emoji> I’ve met lots of young and talented people with good hearts. I am grateful for the warm welcome and hope to stay more in the sunny Tashkent later this year <tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5258073279305889554\"><i class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url('\/\/telegram.org\/img\/emoji\/40\/F09F988E.png')\"><b>😎<\/b><\/i><\/tg-emoji><\/div><\/div><div class=\"media_not_supported_cont\"><div class=\"message_media_not_supported_wrap\">\n  <div class=\"message_media_not_supported\">\n    <div class=\"message_media_not_supported_label\">Please open Telegram to view this post<\/div>\n    <a href=\"https:\/\/t.me\/durov\/295?single\" class=\"message_media_view_in_telegram\">VIEW IN TELEGRAM<\/a>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"media_not_supported_cont\"><div class=\"message_media_not_supported_wrap\">\n  <div class=\"message_media_not_supported\">\n    <div class=\"message_media_not_supported_label\">Please open Telegram to view this post<\/div>\n    <a href=\"https:\/\/t.me\/durov\/295\" class=\"message_media_view_in_telegram\">VIEW IN TELEGRAM<\/a>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"tgme_widget_message_reactions js-message_reactions\"><span class=\"tgme_reaction tgme_reaction_paid\"><i class=\"icon icon-telegram-stars\"><\/i>532<\/span><span class=\"tgme_reaction\"><i class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url('\/\/telegram.org\/img\/emoji\/40\/E29DA4E2808DF09F94A5.